    "            - file:\n",
    "                06_antrian_main.typ\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "Simulasi dulu baru teori.\n",
    "\n",
    "# Simulasi Model Antrian\n",
    "\n",
    "Simulasi **Poisson process** sebenarnya sangat sederhana dan sangat bagus untuk membantu mahasiswa memahami konsep **arrival acak** dalam sistem.\n",
    "\n",
    "Kita akan mensimulasikan dua hal:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **jumlah kejadian dalam waktu tertentu** (Poisson)\n",
    "2. **waktu antar kejadian** (Exponential)\n",
    "\n",
    "Ini langsung menunjukkan hubungan teori yang kita bahas sebelumnya.\n",
    "\n",
    "Seperti biasa kita mulai dengan impor python library yang diperlukan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "43ac8f54",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "cf325037",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Simulasi Poisson Process dengan Python\n",
    "\n",
    "Ide dasar:\n",
    "\n",
    "* waktu antar kedatangan mengikuti **Exponential**\n",
    "* kita terus menambahkan waktu sampai melewati batas waktu total\n",
    "\n",
    "Contoh: simulasi **request server selama 10 detik**.\n",
    "\n",
    "Kita mulai dengan parameter dari random generator."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 2,
   "id": "bb2fdba3",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "## parameter\n",
    "lambda_rate = 2   ## rata-rata 2 request per detik\n",
    "T = 10            ## total waktu simulasi (detik)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 3,
   "id": "fig-datang",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "#| label: fig-datang\n",
    "#| fig-cap: Simulasi Kedatangan exponensial\n",
    "\n",
    "arrival_times = []\n",
    "t = 0\n",
    "\n",
    "while t < T:\n",
    "    ## generate waktu antar kedatangan\n",
    "    interarrival = np.random.exponential(1/lambda_rate)\n",
    "    t += interarrival\n",
    "    \n",
    "    if t < T:\n",
    "        arrival_times.append(t)"
   ]
  },
